# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/ship-4 window (the combined ship candidate; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/ship-4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-ship-4/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# B1 (AFTER THE OWNER APPROVES; refused until then, by design): build the SHIP image from the commit that records the owner's approval, with
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s4 baked as the image's serving default (ENV QWEN_C2_PROFILE) and THATCH_SERVING_SESSION_CAP baked as its
# max-num-seqs (8). REFUSED by c2_serving_job.read_bake and by build-c2-serving-image.sh while the profile's owner_traffic_waiver (id ship4-fx-262k-2026-10-11) has a
# decision that does not start with APPROVED: the owner approves first, the approval is committed (make_fusion_profiles.py --approve-ship), the CPU suite runs on that
# commit, and the tag is pushed on THAT commit (docs/tp4-ship-ln-w2-er.md, docs/tp4-fusion.md). READ: 'baking the serving default
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s4 with a session cap of 8', the provenance report '(c) the image default is the BAKED profile ...', no problem
# line, the image id. A build with the fusion levers' files in the overlay: the overlay manifest is the one image list. Measured basis: the tp4-ship-1 build took 35
# minutes. THE IMAGE BAKES THE K64j-OQ OP GRAFT (C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ): its _ttnncpp.so is the one this profile's lever needs, and a TRAFFIC boot on it is admitted only on
# packed-any records made on that binary (record_packed_any_evidence_tp4.py --binary k64j-oq: the RQ1 and RQ2 jobs of references/fusion-jobs/WPP), so G1, GX1, G2 and SR
# need those records committed first. Duration (estimate): 35 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s4
C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ
